* ============================================================================
* 22_tableA9_external_validation.do — G4 J-L-M §3 external validation
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
*
* V2.0 J-L-M 2026 robustness alignment plan §3 Phase 2 P2.G4:
*   Validate benefit_mean_full against ≥2 firm-level THIRD-PARTY indicators
*   (NCD spread / regulatory penalty / SOA rating; see plan §2 UA-2).
*
* Unit-of-observation note (V2.0 plan §2 M2 修正):
*   J-L-M 2026 §3 uses country-year external Y (credit/GDP/Gini).
*   benefit_society transposes the SAME methodology to bank-year external Y
*   (firm-level), gaining identification strength via within-bank variation.
*
* Acceptance (AC-G4): ≥2 of 3 external Y exhibit sign-match per theory
*   predicted direction (NCD spread ↓ / penalty ↓ / rating ↑ as benefit_mean ↑).
*   P-value significance secondary; sign-match is hard requirement.
*
* USER ACTION REQUIRED (UA-2):
*   Replace placeholders {{EXT_Y1}}, {{EXT_Y2}}, {{EXT_Y3}} with actual column
*   names from CSMAR/Wind/银保监 merge. If <3 indicators available, drop
*   accordingly and update mtitles().
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* ----- 3 external Y regressions (PAP §3 + V2.0 plan P2.G4) -----
* Each Y is firm-year level; predicted sign in parentheses.

* Y1: NCD spread (predicted ↓ as benefit_mean ↑)
capture confirm variable {{EXT_Y1}}
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{EXT_Y1}} {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_type year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo EXT_Y1
}
else {
    display "[INFO] {{EXT_Y1}} not in panel (UA-2 pending); skipping column 1"
}

* Y2: Regulatory penalty count or amount (predicted ↓ as benefit_mean ↑)
capture confirm variable {{EXT_Y2}}
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{EXT_Y2}} {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_type year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo EXT_Y2
}
else {
    display "[INFO] {{EXT_Y2}} not in panel (UA-2 pending); skipping column 2"
}

* Y3: SOA / Wind rating (predicted ↑ as benefit_mean ↑)
capture confirm variable {{EXT_Y3}}
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{EXT_Y3}} {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_type year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo EXT_Y3
}
else {
    display "[INFO] {{EXT_Y3}} not in panel (UA-2 pending); skipping column 3"
}

* ----- Sign-match acceptance scoreboard (V2.0 plan AC-G4) -----
* Manually check β signs in output table; soft acceptance: ≥2/3 sign-match.

esttab EXT_Y* using "$tables_dir/tableA9_external_validation.tex", replace ///
    star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
    title("External Validation (V2.0 plan G4; J-L-M 2026 §3 transposed to firm-year)") ///
    mtitles("NCD spread" "Penalty freq" "Rating") ///
    addnotes("Predicted signs: NCD spread (-), Penalty (-), Rating (+) as benefit_mean increases." ///
             "Acceptance (AC-G4): >=2/3 sign-match with predicted direction." ///
             "Bank-type/year FE; SE clustered at {{CLUSTER_VAR}}.")

* fix(omni-gapfill-08, 2026-06-12): CSV side-channel — papers/benefit_society/
* tables.py:build_table_a9_external_validation 经 read_paper_esttab(...,
* 'tableA9_external_validation.csv') 消费 (parse_esttab_csv 格式)。
estout EXT_Y* using "$tables_dir/tableA9_external_validation.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
    cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
    starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) mlabels("NCD spread" "Penalty freq" "Rating")

display "[OK] Table A9 external validation --> $tables_dir/tableA9_external_validation.tex (+ .csv side-channel)"
